# Meeting Scheduling API Test Requests
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar tools

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/meetings
@prodUrl = https://data-scube-be.onrender.com/api/meetings

### 1. Get available slots for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/slots?date=2024-11-05
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get available slots for tomorrow
GET {{baseUrl}}/slots?date=2024-11-06
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Book a meeting slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_SLOT_ID",
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "1234567890",
  "customerCompany": "ABC Corporation",
  "meetingPurpose": "product-demo",
  "meetingDescription": "Interested in learning about your ERP solutions for our manufacturing business"
}

### 4. Get all bookings (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Get bookings by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?status=confirmed&page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get booking by reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/booking/MTG-ABC123
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get customer bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/customer/john@example.com/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Update booking (Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/booking/REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "meetingLink": "https://meet.google.com/abc-def-ghi",
  "notes": "Great meeting! Customer is interested in the premium package."
}

### 9. Cancel booking
PUT {{baseUrl}}/booking/REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested to reschedule due to emergency"
}

### 10. Get booking statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats
Content-Type: application/json

### Production URLs (replace baseUrl with prodUrl)

### Get available slots (Production)
GET {{prodUrl}}/slots?date=2024-11-05
Content-Type: application/json

### Book meeting (Production)
POST {{prodUrl}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_SLOT_ID",
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "customerEmail": "jane@company.com",
  "customerPhone": "9876543210",
  "customerCompany": "XYZ Ltd",
  "meetingPurpose": "consultation",
  "meetingDescription": "Need consultation for digital transformation project"
}